      "start": 123,
      "end": 229,
      "sourceExcerpt": "第1步。记dist(x,Z)=min_{k∈Z}|x-k|。对任意实数x均有0≤dist(x,Z)≤1/2，且dist(x+k,Z)=dist(x,Z)（整数k）。我们在固定正整数r后求使上述条件能成立的最大C。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_0",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-1",
      "index": 1,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 230,
      "end": 326,
      "sourceExcerpt": "第2步。若r为奇数，所有数列均受C≤1/2限制。取a_1=1/2，a_n=r^(n-1)/2。因r^(n-1)为奇数，a_n是半整数，故所有n的dist(a_n,Z)=1/2，最佳C为1/2。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_1",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-2",
      "index": 2,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 327,
      "end": 429,
      "sourceExcerpt": "第3步。以下设r=2m，其中m≥1为整数。令c=m/(2m+1)=r/(2(r+1))，则0<c<1/2。对任意实数x选最邻近整数k，写x=k+δ且|δ|≤1/2。若|δ|≤c，则dist(x,Z)≤c。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_2",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-3",
      "index": 3,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 430,
      "end": 552,
      "sourceExcerpt": "第4步。若c<|δ|≤1/2，则r|δ|=2m|δ|落在(m-c,m]。由于r为整数，rx=rk+rδ的最近整数可以选rk±m，所以dist(rx,Z)≤m-r|δ|<c。因而对每个x必有min(dist(x,Z),dist(rx,Z))≤c。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_3",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-4",
      "index": 4,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 553,
      "end": 633,
      "sourceExcerpt": "第5步。任何公比为r的数列满足a_2=ra_1。将第4步用在x=a_1，得dist(a_1,Z)与dist(a_2,Z)至少一个不大于c。所以任何适用的C≤c。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_4",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-5",
      "index": 5,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 634,
      "end": 766,
      "sourceExcerpt": "第6步。取a_1=m/(2m+1)，并设a_n=r^(n-1)a_1。模整数计算：2m≡-1 (mod 2m+1)，故对任意n，a_n与(-1)^(n-1)m/(2m+1)相差整数。因0<m/(2m+1)<1/2，所以dist(a_n,Z)=m/(2m+1)=c。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_5",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
